{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36140","headline":"题雪窦禅师壁 · 方干","name":"题雪窦禅师壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"飞泉溅禅石，缾注亦生苔。\n海上山不浅，天边人自来。\n长年随桧柏，独夜任风雷。\n猎者闻疎磬，知师入定回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36140.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36140","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}